{
  "title": "Insurance Business Overview",
  "description": "PoC insurance-business-observability | env:local | ms-propostas -> Outbox -> Kafka -> ms-cadastro. Queries use received series; metrics are best effort, not a financial ledger. Owner scope: this PoC only. https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=project%3Ainsurance-business-observability%20env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29 https://us5.datadoghq.com/apm/traces?query=env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "local"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "available_values": [
        "ms-propostas",
        "ms-cadastro"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Insurance Business Observability — operação de propostas**\n\nCriações e processamentos são marcos distintos da mesma proposta. Não some as etapas como propostas adicionais. Métricas não substituem os bancos operacionais.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Propostas novas registradas",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.business.transitions{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,step:proposal_register}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 4,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Propostas novas processadas no cadastro",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.business.transitions{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,step:proposal_receive}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 4,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Sucesso técnico de criação (%) — sem replays/conflitos",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "success",
                "query": "sum:insurance.proposal.registrations{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:created}.as_count()",
                "aggregator": "sum"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "attempted",
                "query": "sum:insurance.proposal.registrations{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,!outcome:replayed,!outcome:rejected}.as_count()",
                "aggregator": "sum"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "100 * success / attempted"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 2,
        "custom_unit": "percent"
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 4,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Transições bem-sucedidas por etapa",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.business.transitions{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:success} by {step}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Duração média por etapa (ms)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {step,outcome}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Falhas técnicas por etapa — sem série até a primeira falha",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:technical_failure} by {step,error_code}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Criações e replays da API",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.proposal.registrations{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {outcome}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Rejeição de risco/aprovação:** jornada ainda não implementada; nenhum KPI fictício. Conflito de idempotência é rejeição HTTP, não rejeição de negócio.\n\n**Produto:** product_key existe em logs e productKey em spans. Não há tag de produto nas métricas; use Logs Explorer e facet opcional.\n\n[Logs Explorer](https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=project%3Ainsurance-business-observability%20env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29) | [APM](https://us5.datadoghq.com/apm/traces?query=env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29)\n\nFiltre por business_id nos logs e businessId nos spans. IDs não são tags de métricas.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      }
    }
  ]
}
